WEBVTT - Search, SEO and agents: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.707
A site now has to be found three ways: by search
engines, by its own search and by AI agents.

2
00:00:10.807 --> 00:00:17.455
Search, SEO and agents: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:28.746
Sitemaps, canonical URLs, hreflang, meta tags,
Open Graph and robots rules with EXT:seo.

4
00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:38.781
It starts where the symptoms show: language
versions mixed up in Google, or a sitemap with
only the home page in it.

5
00:00:40.181 --> 00:00:48.083
Builds schema.org JSON-LD from the records that
render the page, and keeps it through an
upgrade.

6
00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:54.931
The validator finds no errors. The graph says
what the page shows.

7
00:00:56.031 --> 00:01:04.115
Runs and debugs Apache Solr search: indexing,
facets, suggest, PDFs and stuck queues.

8
00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:10.963
A Solr server that accepts documents can still
drop unknown fields.

9
00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:20.421
Makes search, navigation and forms usable as
typed WebMCP tools for browser agents.

10
00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:27.818
An agent fills the form. The consent box stays
empty; a person sends it.

11
00:01:29.118 --> 00:01:33.075
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
